{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a25aca3ef9f53917","type":"tool_result","content":"333\t// RunReconcileLoop runs one reconcile pass immediately at startup, then every\n334\t// defaultReconcileIntervalSeconds until ctx is cancelled. ReconcileOnce returns\n335\t// nil for all vault-side failures, so this loop cannot crash the executor when\n336\t// git-rest is unreachable — the next tick just retries (spec 005 Failure Modes).\n337\tfunc (h *taskEventHandler) RunReconcileLoop(ctx context.Context) error {\n338\t\tif err := h.ReconcileOnce(ctx); err != nil {\n339\t\t\tglog.Errorf(\"event=reconcile initial pass failed: %v\", err)\n340\t\t}\n341\t\tticker := time.NewTicker(defaultReconcileIntervalSeconds)\n342\t\tdefer ticker.Stop()\n343\t\tfor {\n344\t\t\tselect {\n345\t\t\tcase <-ctx.Done():\n346\t\t\t\treturn nil\n347\t\t\tcase <-ticker.C:\n348\t\t\t\tif err := h.ReconcileOnce(ctx); err != nil {\n349\t\t\t\t\tglog.Errorf(\"event=reconcile tick failed: %v\", err)\n350\t\t\t\t}\n351\t\t\t}\n352\t\t}\n353\t}\n354\t```\n355\t\n356\t6. Add the counter to `/workspace/pkg/metrics/metrics.go`, after `JobsSpawnedTotal` (after line 27):\n357\t```go\n358\t// ReconcileRedrivenTotal counts tasks re-driven by the reconcile loop after a\n359\t// restart dropped their in-memory deferral state (spec 005).\n360\tvar ReconcileRedrivenTotal = promauto.NewCounter(\n361\t\tprometheus.CounterOpts{\n362\t\t\tName: \"executor_reconcile_redriven_total\",\n363\t\t\tHelp: \"Total number of tasks re-driven by the reconcile loop.\",\n364\t\t},\n365\t)\n366\t```\n367\tExtend `/workspace/pkg/metrics/metrics_test.go` (the first `It` block, line ~19) so the expected registered names also include `\"executor_reconcile_redriven_total\"`.\n368\t\n369\t7. Wire the factory in `/workspace/pkg/factory/factory.go`:\n370\t   a. Add a new factory function (zero logic — forward only):\n371\t   ```go\n372\t   // CreateGitRestClient returns the read-only git-rest vault