{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-84919e6ddc228610","type":"tool_result","content":"/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:8:workflow: direct\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:15:Two dimensions control git behavior: **separation** (`workflow:` enum) and **delivery** (`pr`, `autoMerge`, `autoRelease` booleans).\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:18:workflow: branch\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:26:| `workflow` | `direct` (default) \\| `branch` \\| `worktree` \\| `clone` | Isolation level |\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:27:| `pr` | `false` (default) \\| `true` | Push branch and open PR (incompatible with `workflow: direct`) |\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:31:For the full matrix, container semantics, and choosing a mode, see [workflows.md](workflows.md).\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:34:- `worktree: bool` — mapped to a `workflow:` value (see [workflows.md](workflows.md#migration-from-legacy-config))\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:35:- `workflow: pr` — mapped to `workflow: clone` + `pr: true`\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:37:`autoRelease` semantics: When `false` (default), commits stay local (no push, no tag). When `true` and `CHANGELOG.md` exists, commits are pushed AND `## Unreleased` is bumped to `## vX.Y.Z` with a tag pushed. When `true` without `CHANGELOG.md`, commits are pushed but no tag is created. Works in all workflows.\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:198:hideGit: true\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:228:| `hideGit` | `false` | Hide git status from YOLO container by default |\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:252:msg=\"effective config\" model=claude-opus-4-7 modelSource=global hideGit=true hideGitSource=global ...\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:492:dark-factory run --set hideGit=true\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:496:dark-factory run --set workflow=branch --set pr=true\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:506:| `hideGit` | bool (`true` or `false`) | `--set hideGit=true` |\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:511:| `workflow` | enum (`direct` \\| `branch` \\| `worktree` \\| `clone`) | `--set workflow=branch` |\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:520:The `workflow: pr` legacy yaml value is **not** accepted via `--set`. Use `--set workflow=clone --set pr=true` instead (the yaml loader maps the legacy value at load time; the arg layer intentionally does not reproduce that mapping).\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:562:**Layering precedence**: default (`false`) ← global (`~/.config/dark-factory/config.yaml`, XDG-first) ← project (`.dark-factory.yaml`) ← CLI (`--set`). Matches `hideGit`, `autoRelease`, and other user-pref fields.\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:570:A project configured for `workflow: direct` (no clone, no auto-worktree) can still be run safely against a worktree you create by hand. Combine global `hideGit` with per-invocation auto-release-off — no project-config edits needed.\n/home/node/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/dark-factory/docs/configuration.md:576:hideGit: true","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-82d8c962a4bd571f","session_id":"3667b84f-c892-4ca5-8115-a830204bf3b3","uuid":"54e9e936-63c6-4ab5-843d-3a29387f67a2","timestamp":"2026-09-